            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.16+1KI.10.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Isham 10:16-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.15+2CH.9.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Imila 9:15-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Shishaki imfumu ya ku Egupto yasanshile Yerusalemu, yasendele icipao conse ica mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe elyo ne cuma ca mwisano. Yasenda fyonsefye pamo pene ne nkwela sha golide isho Solomoni apangile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi imfumu Reoboamu epakupanga inkwela shimbi isha mukuba ishakupyanikishapo, elyo ashipeela ku bakalamba ba bakalinda abali pa ncito yakulinda pa mwinshi wa kwisano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inshita yonse ilyo imfumu yaya ku ŋanda yakwa Yawe, bakalinda baya nankwe nabasenda inkwela, elyo panuma bashibwesha ku muputule wa bakalinda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa mulandu wakuti Reoboamu aicefya umwine, ubukali bwakwa Yawe bwafumako kuli ena, na Yawe tamonawile. Ne cacine, mwalisangilwe ubusuma mu Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imfumu Reoboamu yakosha bwino ukuteeka kwaiko mu Yerusalemu, yatwalilila no kuba imfumu. Yali ne myaka amakumi yane na umo (41) ilyo yaishile pa bufumu. Yateekele pa myaka ikumi limo na cine lubali (17) mu Yerusalemu, umusumba uo Yawe asalile ukufuma mu nko shonse isha bena Israeli umwakuba ishina lyakwe. Nyina ishina lyakwe ali ni Naama, umwina Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acitile ububi pa mulandu wakuti tabikile umutima wakwe kukufwaya Yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palwa fintu fimbi ifya pa bufumu bwakwa Reoboamu, ukufumafye pa kutendeka ukufikafye na ku mpela, bushe tafyalembwa mu mashiwi yakwa Shemaiya kasesema elyo na mu yakwa Ido kamona ayo ayalondolola pa nkulo? Palikonkenye ukuba ulubuli pakati kakwa Reoboamu elyo na Yeroboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reoboamu aile lala ukwalala ifikolwe fyakwe kabili bamushiikile mu musumba wakwa Davidi. Elyo Abiya umwana wakwe ewamupyene pa bufumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
